  "description": "Amendment of planning permission dated 30th July 2024 (RN 24/02160/FULL) for the Comprehensive refurbishment of the buildings, in connection with use of all of the upper floors as office accommodation (Use Class E), erection of a setback rooftop extension, and a double mansard extension with new dormer windows to the Glasshouse Street elevation including new amenity terraces; alterations to Glasshouse Street chimneys and new plant equipment and screening; external alterations to Glasshouse Street facades including new retail shopfront, new office reception entrance and glazing, new service entrance and associated works; internal alterations including enlargement of the office reception at ground floor, infilling the atrium to provide additional office accommodation (Use Class E) at first floor, and the relocation of the goods corridor on the ground floor; and other associated works. NAMELY, integration of Glasshouse Street dry riser inlet into the glazing system; Minor amendment to location of office plate notional stairs and ramps; Omission of external wall lining; Minor amendment to Atrium Rooflight glass panel sizes; and omission of Level 7 rooflight."
